	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Amplissimas gratias ut agerem per te domino consuli <persName ref="p1888">Lavatero</persName> de sua singulari fide, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>iussus sum; habebit utrique et referet brevi senatus noster.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Iam nunc <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scribam expectamus, cuius itidem laboribus pro merito faciemus satis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>De <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> quod nunciasti, nuper ex <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpia</placeName> ille noster, quem novisti, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>literis suis mihi significavit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Adiecit tamen, protectorem regium in vinculis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>esse ac mox et legatum illum captum esse, qui proxima aestate in aula <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><persName>Caroli</persName> egit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Olfecerunt enim <placeName>Angli</placeName> factionem adversus evangelium coeptam, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quae iis mediis fortassis emerget.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Polus non quiescit, quem suo polo destituet[-at] <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dominus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18250">Mauritius</persName> elector n nuperis nundinis <placeName ref="l284">Lipsensibus</placeName> per praeconem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>se purgavit: nunquam eo animo se fuisse, ut evangelio suus cursus inhiberetur, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sed velle se, ut omni sua in ditione libere et intrepide praedicetur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Proinde et <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgensibus</placeName> mercatoribus in iisdem nundinis concessum, ut libere me<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>rces suas distrahant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Constans fama, Caesarem iuxta nos hyematurum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et ad verna intraturum <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>; sed et ex <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> allatas illi [litera<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>s] parum laetas de Gsariffo, <placeName>Mauritanię</placeName> duce potentissimo, et Draguto, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>classis <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicae</placeName> praefecto, quos certo ferunt ingenti vi armatorum in <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>regnum <placeName>Granadae</placeName> irrupturos.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Qua caussa et in <placeName ref="l875">Hispanias</placeName> abiturum Cae[sar<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>em] multi suspicantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nosti forte <persName>Ferdinandi</persName> filiam nuper <placeName ref="l1060">Mantuam</placeName> deductam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>esse, quo Mantuano duci coniungatur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Est hic <persName ref="p17907">Ferdinandi Gonzagae</persName> ex fratre nepo[s], <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>haud omnino incommodus ad cohibendos <placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName>, ne facile sese cum <placeName ref="l832">Ga[lli]</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>copiis coniungere possint.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Pontificem autem omnem operam suam et ope[s] <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> condixisse certissimum est, neque es levis caussa est, cur sic instanter <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>in nostros saeviat religionis nomine <placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Mire autem glisce[re] <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>favorem amplectendi evangelii in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> universa clarissimus ille prae<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sul <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p3375">Petrus Paulus Vergerius</persName> asseruit, triduo apud nos <placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>moratus et iucundissime multis de rebus commentatus; qui sa<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ne te nulla mora diisset, verum commotus rumore contagionis <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>tam constante <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> abiit, illi[c] mensibus forte plusculis <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>haesiturus, donec lucubrationes aliquot suas penitus absolvat.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Vir est doctus, eloquens, pius et tui amantissimus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">De legatis <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> reversis forte audiisti.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Tractati sunt honorifice <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>et humanissime dimissi, torquati omnes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Pagis enim donati sunt <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>pro reditu aurei coronati 300, sociis 150, hoc est dimidium; <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Valesiis tamen hoc datum, quod pagis; der dryen Pöndten ist <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>ain ieder Pont für ain ort gerechnet und iede 300 kronen zuͦr <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>haimkerung, idem ouch ain kettin für 500 kronen, wie ainem <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>andern ort, den andern zuͦgwandten aber iedem ain kettin für 200v. <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Ist unserm pottem nur zuͦ vil gwesen, aht sin nit begert.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tanta <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>tamen et tam insolens quorundam fuit mendicitas, ut audientem <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>me plane <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiae</placeName> nostrae nomine puduerit tedueritque.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Die fryungen <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l301">Leyon</placeName>, unsern gwerb belangend, habend mein herren nach irem begeren erlangt.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Hoc enim sol<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>um spectabamus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName> 8. novembris, anno 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Dem wirdigen und achtba<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>rn herren M. <persName ref="p495">Hainrichen Bullinger</persName>, praedicanten <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> zuͦm Großen Münster, meinem günstigen herren.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
